window.products.push({"id":642177,"name":"Nroech Over The Toilet Storage, 2-Tier Standing Over Toilet Bathroom Organizer Countertop Shelf, No Drilling Required Bathroom Storage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wDeUS8ccL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXCELLENT SPACE ORGANIZER: Are you sick of your bathroom getting messy? This bathroom counter organizer maximizes space in the bathroom, stores your belongings in an organised way and makes everything in the bathroom in good order and well arranged. The two-tier open design makes it easy to access and clean. HIGH QUALITY: Our bathroom organizer countertop are made of solid wood, the surface waterproof coating prevents water damage. The brackets on both sides are made of high-quality thickened steel for high load-bearing capacity. The steel surface is sprayed with a frosted coating, which is rust-proof and waterproof, and stands the test of time. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: Each frame and tray is pre-drilled and can be assembled in less than five minutes without measuring. If you want to use it over the toilet, using the attached adhesive hook and it can well fixed to the toilet, no need to worry about it shaking or falling during use. MULTIPURPOSE: The bathroom counter organizer is also suitable for kitchen organizer and toilet storage. It can be as a cosmetic organizer, spice organizer, coffee organizer, etc. The wooden elements of the bathroom shelves can also decorate your home and are a great addition to your home. PERFECT SIZE: The bathroom countertop organizer size is 13.07” L x 6.22” W, the counter standing rack's overall height is 15.25 inch. The right size is better for free up your space!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wDeUS8ccL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nroech","source_asin":"B0BRC7XF6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRC7XF6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRC7XF6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
