window.products.push({"id":642222,"name":"AIYEGO Knife Sharpener, Portable 3-Stage Manual Kitchen Sharpening Tool Repair, Restore and Polish Blades","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+A0DT47dL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Descriptions: While you are cutting an apple with a fruit knife, or carving a turkey with a chef’s knife, a sharp blade is always needed. And then, our knife sharpener would be a great help to sharp the blades, as the necessary kitchen tools for you. It is used for metal material knives, such as bread knife, kitchen knife, fruit knife, chopping knife, chef knife, bone knife etc. But please do not use for ceramic knife, serrated knife, wavy knife or scissors. No tedious grinding, no worries about any damages to your expensive knives. Features: wide applicability, fast sharpeners Material: 304 Stainless Steel + ABS plastic + Rubber Product size: 20.5*7.5*6.5cm Net weight: 168g Package weight: 200g Scope of application: fruit knife, kitchen knife, chopping knife, etc. 3-stage Design for FINE grinding(Ceramic rod), COARSE grinding(Tungsten steel blade), and CERAMIC grinding(Diamond rod). How to Use the knife sharpener: 1.If your knife is a little blunt, please use the FINE grinding to pull back 5 times in the same direction. 2.If your knife is blunt, please use the CERAMIC grinding to pull back 5 times in the same direction, then please switch into the FINE grinding for 5 times. 3.If your knife is very blunt, please use the COARSE grinding to create the sharpened 'V' edge by pulling back 5 times, which would grind off some steel scraps, and after that, please switch into the CERAMIC grinding for 5 times. Finally, please use the FINE grinding for 5 times. NOTE: In order to protect the blade, please draw out the knife in the SAME DIRECTION , with its head slightly downward, and pressure not too much. Warmly Tips: 1.Please make sure not to put the sharpener into the dishwasher or water. 2.Please keep the sharpener and the cutter in a place that is away from children. Package Contents: 1 x 3-Stage Knife Sharpener","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+A0DT47dL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIYEGO","source_asin":"B07W1YBXKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W1YBXKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W1YBXKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
