window.products.push({"id":642315,"name":"thermos for hot food mug an vacuum coffee bottle ， cold hot water insulated flask。 stainless steel thermo tea container (Stainless steel, 500 ml)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oNAnEcB7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"In terms of quality and performance, you will not find a better made insulated beverage product. don't keep drinks cold or warm enough - need filling often - are too big for cup holders/bike Racks? -Our new Triple wall design with an extra copper layer helps to keep your drinks hot and cold for a longer time. -Our new top top keeps a much better vacuum seal which keeps your beverage hot or cold much longer. For convenience Your insulated water bottle will keep your drinks super cool or hot. Easy fit for cup holders, bike Racks, back packs. 17oz/500 ML means longer time between fills. For health -Hydrate with safe, refreshingly cool drinks at the office, gym, yoga or outdoors hiking, biking, kayaking. Or enjoy warming herbal tea. For sustainability -Your reusable water bottle uses top quality travel Thermoses 18/8 stainless steel for inner and outer walls guaranteeing tough, durable, rust proof, sustainable and no metallic taste and Gloss coated brushed stainless steel. We know you will love it and want to Gift it to family/friends so we have packaged it in a really nice box. We take pride in our stainless steel hot & cold Thermoses flask; we use it and love it. Don't forget, Timeless. Natural. Enduring. Products that help you savor every moment with a hot cup of coffee or tea. Products designed to endure and enhance your life's many experiences. we offer a no questions asked 100% money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oNAnEcB7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECOOJ","source_asin":"B07VR8Z844","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VR8Z844","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VR8Z844","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":642316,"name":"Tea Infuser Tea Strainer for Loose Leaf Tea & Cooking Infuser, Extra Fine Mesh Tea Diffuser 18/8 Stainless Steel Tea Ball Spice Bulk Tea Steeper Fit f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T4ZGTQNyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤A NEW DRINK EXPERIENCE of LIFE❤:Relative to the usual tea bag, this tea ball strainer brings us much more newer experience and enjoy the fun of brewing fresh tea! The package of our tea strainer includes 2x push-on lids, 2x ultra-fine mesh cups, and 2x trays.All the parts are made of 18/8 stainless steel. Easy to clean and dishwashable. ❤NEW BUCKLE--CONNECTION DESIGH❤: Unlike traditional tea ball or threaded connection infuser, our tea strainer features buckled connection design that you’ll feel easier to open and close when using. Besides, during the process of brewing, it seals more tightly so that the tea leaves will never leak out from it. ❤STRONG VERSATILITY：The tea ball infusers' Dimension❤: 3.8 x 2.6 x 2.2 inches and Extended 4.7\" chains. Fit nearly all the teapots, mugs or cups of different size, so K Kitcherish's high-quality professional tea infuser is your best choice. ❤EXTRA FINE MESH FEATURE❤:The extra-fine mesh tea strainer allows the tea leaves, particles or grounds intact to loosen completely while preventing from the flavor to drift out during the brewing process. ❤SETS FOR GIFTS❤:This kind of tea strainers are a must-have for all tea lovers. They are also perfect gifts for various holidays and leisure occasions, which let them enjoy the fun of brewing fresh tea and the accomplishment afterwards as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T4ZGTQNyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"K Kitcherish","source_asin":"B09572YYYK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09572YYYK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09572YYYK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
