window.products.push({"id":642544,"name":"2 Layer Slow Cooker Carrier, Compatible with 6, 7, 8 Quart Crock-Pot, Insulated Large Slow Cooker Travel Bag with Bottom Pad Lid Fasten Straps, for Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iccJ-A4xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍲【2 Layer Extra-Large Capacity】: YOREPEK slow cooker carrying case measures 16.9 x 13.7 x 11.4 inches, compatible with most 5, 6, 7, 8 quart oval slow cookers. The slow cooker carrier has a top separate compartment for putting kitchen utensils and recipes, and a front zippered pocket for accessories or other items you need. 🍲【Insulated liner, Clean Up was a Breeze】: The interior of the 8 quart carrier is lined with a padded insulated aluminum foil lining, which keeps food warm for longer, also easy to clean, and easy to remove stains. The exterior of the crockpot carrier bag insulated oval is made of waterproof heavy-duty material, which gives your pot more protection. 🍲【Hold the Cooker Tightly in place】: Slow cooker travel bag has a sturdy hard insert for supporting the bottom of the bag, plus an inner panel with 4 holes that connect with straps from the bottom, both securely hold the slow cooker in place while transporting. The holding strap wraps completely around the slow cooker so that it added security in toting a heavy dish and no worries about spilling or slipping contents in your car. 🍲【2 Options for Carrying】: The Portable slow cooker carrying case has 2 slots on each side, and the slow cooker handle can stick out to be exposed for steady transporting with 2 hands, which allows you can grab the handles and carry it this way. There are padded handle straps on the outside of the slow cooker travel bag, which will reduce the burden during carrying, easy to carry with one hand. 🍲【Various Application Scenarios】: No spilling or mess while traveling. This makes traveling with your slow cooker so much easier. This Yorepek slow cooker bags is suitable for different scenarios, whether it is when you need to carry food with slow cooker traveling on vacation, camping, picnic, and transport, or take it to a family gathering, holiday dinner, party, or office pot-lucks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iccJ-A4xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOREPEK","source_asin":"B09Y5M1ZLR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y5M1ZLR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y5M1ZLR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
