window.products.push({"id":642634,"name":"C.R. Gibson Lolita Ultimate Acrylic Glitter Wine Glass, Family collection, with Westwood Gourmet Bottle Opener (Best Sister Ever)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WZhZvPm0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect gift for the women in your life- celebrate family relationships or milestones with these glitter infused acrylic wine stems! As a designer, Lolita sees something quite extraordinary in the everyday and ordinary of life. She brings her vision into her products as a reflection of the Lolita lifestyle. It's a balance of fun, entertaining and celebrating moments with the special people in our lives. Whether you're having girlfriends over for margaritas or hosting a family get together, Lolita serve ware, drink ware, hostess aprons and kitchen textiles are the perfect elements to create a memorable occasion indoors or outdoors. There's only one Lolita. Lolita is brought to you by C.R. Gibson, synonymous with quality for more than 140 years. Starting with the creation of the very first baby book in 1898, families around the world have depended on C.R. Gibson as their number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. Understanding the importance of preservation and craftsmanship, C.R. Gibson products offer a tradition of excellence and quality. C.R. Gibson's commitment to excellence can also be seen in their commitment to design. C.R. Gibson sets a standard for style that reflects today's top fashions while creating a timeless treasured keepsake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WZhZvPm0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B06XQN16ZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XQN16ZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XQN16ZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
