window.products.push({"id":642667,"name":"QueenFun LED Bathroom Mirror, 20x28 Anti-Fog Bathroom Wall Mirror with Front and Backlit, Double UL Listed LED Lights, Memory & Stepless Dimming Mirro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NF4ydVaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Individual-Controllable LEDs & Over 9 Light Effects】- With the individual-controllable lights and the \"stepless\" dimming, plus colour adjustment function, you'll get over 9 light effects to meet different needs. Ex. Turn on both the front & back light, adjust to 80% lumen to do your makeup when you're in a hurry to go on a date! Or only turn on the backlit and choose a warm yellow to make your bedroom romantic at night! The mirror will memorize your previous settings! 【Low Consumption & Durable LED Strips】- Built-in two high-density LED strips, the light is vivid but not dazzling, without a visible strobe effect. The LED lifetime is 50,000 hours (it can last 45 years if used 3 hours daily!) 【Safe & Anti-fog Waterproof Mirror】- The UL-listed LED strips equipped are waterproof. The backlight is wrapped with high-quality diffusion plate material, providing better tightness. With the built-in fast defogger, the water mist will quickly disappear while activating the defog function; if you forget to close it, the power will turn off automatically 1 hour later. The equipped LETARON power control passed the FCC&UL Certification. It provides a safe and noiseless use experience. 【Eco-friendly & Shatter-proof】 - The LED wall mirror is a 3rd-generation eco-friendly glass, we use a denser passivator as coating material to replace copper in order to prevent oxidation and reduce damage risk with an eco-friendly way. The upgraded 3rd generation technology, using a better solution and manufacturing technique, makes it have a higher reflectivity and longer lifespan. The explosion-proof HD mirror enhances its safety. 【Easy Installation & 2-Way to Wire】- Just screw the provided french cleat bracket on the wall and install the mirror on it; so easy! You can hang this functional mirror horizontally or vertically. The mirror can be powered by a plugin or hardwired. 【5 Years Warranty】- We provide a 5-years warranty, please contact us first if you are not satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NF4ydVaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QueenFun","source_asin":"B0BW4JCTTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW4JCTTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW4JCTTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
