window.products.push({"id":642913,"name":"Giantex Buffet Sideboard, Wood Storage Cabinet, Console Table with 4 Drawers, 2-Door Credenza, Living Room Dining Room Furniture, Buffet Server, Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KhqQ2pE-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"『4 Drawers & 3-Tier Cabinet Offering Ample Storage Space』: Spacious tabletop offers easy-to-access storage space to put handy things, and 4 drawers provide ample space to classify your items and keep them in order. Besides, the 3-layer cabinet has enough displayed space to hold your favorite bowls, mugs, spoons, or board games. 『Sturdy Wood Construction & Durable Material』: Made of premium MDF, this buffet sideboard is stable and durable. Equipped with metal reinforced connections, the cabinet is sturdy enough to bear up your items. Plus doors with high clarity can display your valuable collections in a safe way. 『Elegant & Antique Buffet Sideboard』: With rounded corners and smooth lines, this modern style sideboard creates rich visual diversity and fits a variety of styles of home decoration. 4 round feet add uniqueness to the kitchen cabinet, and 2 transparent doors enhance visual attractiveness. 『Kitchen Pantry Cupboard or Entryway Console Table』: The anti-toppling device at the rear of this sideboard can avoid accidents and enhance security during usage. This stylish and practical storage cabinet can be used in the dining room, kitchen, living room and entryway to make the messy room tidy. 『Easy to Assemble with Detailed Manual』: The console table comes with all needed instructions and hardware, so it is easy to finish it up without saving much time and energy. Since the smooth surface and concealed design, the sideboard can be maintained and cleaned with a wet towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KhqQ2pE-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B08W3G3PKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W3G3PKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W3G3PKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":642914,"name":"Ancient Greek Zamac Miniature Statue of Hera (1336)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71el2-+HRhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hera (/ˈhɛrə/, Greek Ἥρα, Hēra, equivalently Ἥρη, Hērē, in Ionic and Homer) is the wife and one of three sisters of Zeus in the Olympian pantheon of Greek mythology and religion. Her chief function was as the goddess of women and marriage. Her counterpart in the religion of ancient Rome was Juno.The cow, lion and the peacock were considered sacred to her. Hera's mother is Rhea and her father Cronus. Portrayed as majestic and solemn, often enthroned, and crowned with the polos (a high cylindrical crown worn by several of the Great Goddesses), Hera may bear a pomegranate in her hand, emblem of fertile blood and death and a substitute for the narcotic capsule of the opium poppy.A scholar of Greek mythology Walter Burkert writes in Greek Religion, \"Nevertheless, there are memories of an earlier aniconic representation, as a pillar in Argos and as a plank in Samos.\" Hera was known for her jealous and vengeful nature, most notably against Zeus's lovers and offspring, but also against mortals who crossed her, such as Pelias. Paris offended her by choosing Aphrodite as the most beautiful goddess, earning Hera's hatred.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71el2-+HRhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iconsgr","source_asin":"B00GFQJUL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GFQJUL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GFQJUL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
