window.products.push({"id":642925,"name":"Choowin 3 in 1 Wrap Dispenser, Acrylic Plastic Wrap Dispenser Aluminum Foil Dispenser Wax Paper Dispenser with Cutter, Plastic Wrap Organizer Aluminum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VSS2kA2GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Advantage 3 In 1 wrap dispenser: 3 in 1 plastic wrap organizer with cutter is designed for storing plastic wrap, aluminum foil and wax paper. With it, you can no longer struggle to tear plastic wrap by hand, or hunt around for scissors. Our aluminum foil organizer with cutter will be the perfect choice for you! Quality materials: Our wrap dispenser is made of high quality acrylic board, which is sturdy, easy to clean. Compared to wood, it doesn't mold and is easy to scrub when dirty. Sturdy and wear-resistant features allow you to use it more safely and for longer. Transparent design makes it easy to replenish rolls at any time. Transparent material can match any decoration style, simple and fashionable. No assembly required. Safe cutting: The plastic wrap cutting machine adopts a two-way hidden stainless steel cutter head, which does not slide out during cutting. Each groove has a flexible sliding cutter supports sliding back and forth. You can easily and neatly cut plastic wrap, aluminum foil and wax paper. Larger opening design, you can pick up the roll start easily. Easy and safe to use. Color and size Clear: 13.6\"L x 2.8\"W x 8.9\"H inch(34.5x7x22.5cm) Package including 1 x Acrylic Wrap Organizer (with screws) Warm tips *Please allow a little error on the size due to manual measurement. *The color might have a slight difference due to different displays. *Please read the size instruction carefully before purchasing. *If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VSS2kA2GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Choowin","source_asin":"B0BFR48SH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-642925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFR48SH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFR48SH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
