window.products.push({"id":643000,"name":"Unihouse White Floating Shelves Wall Mounted, White Rustic Wooden Wall Shelf for Living Room, Bathroom, Laundry, Kitchen, Easy to Assemble, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WS4gXDaBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Practical and Space-saving】Unihouse 2-tier wood wall shelves are multifunctional and practical. This versatile wall mounted shelves can be used in your bathroom, living room, bedroom, laundry, kitchen, study room, and office. These wall storage shelves provide you more space to store your items in different place, and make your home tidy and clean. Ideal for for saving space. 【Premium Quality】Unihouse floating shelves are made of high density E1 MDF board and thick metal brackets. They are durable, sturdy and moisture-proof. Strong enough to hold your collections, photos，books, bathroom accessories, and coffee supplies. Each wall shelf size is 15.8\"(L) x 5.9\"(W) x 3.6\"(H), and 0.6\" thick. Every shelf holds up to 40 pounds, so you can put much stuff on it. 【Stylish Decoration】White color matches all kinds of furniture and family decoration style perfectly, and add some decor in your home. Besides storing some articles of daily use, it will be wonderful and exquisite for placing some small potted plants, flowers, ornaments on the decorative board to make your home more elegant and fascinating! 【Easy Installation】The floating shelves are easy to assemble. There are two different ways by adjusting brackets upside or down to install it to match your decorations. Different installation way, different style. We offer instruction, level checker and all necessary accessories are included, and it will be easy to assemble them if you follow the instruction. 【Perfect Gift】Based on the wide used of the space-saving shelf and the modern decoration in many places. It will be a nice housewarming gift for your family, friends and colleagues. 【Customer Service】Customer experience is at the forefront of our brand. If you have any question about us, please feel free to contact us, we will solve it as soon as possible. We also offer a 1-year limited warranty from date of purchase. 【Note】There is no pre-drilled hole on the board. This design allows you to freely choose the installation position between the bracket and the board according to the installation wall needs. It is easy to twist the screws into the board (see the installation guide video). If you are still confused about this,don't worry, please feel free to contact us and we will try our best to resolve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WS4gXDaBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unihouse","source_asin":"B095NPXTD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095NPXTD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095NPXTD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643001,"name":"Byers' Choice Yes Virginia Newsman","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yfEUjBO-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Many of us are familiar with the iconic story of \"Yes, Virginia, there is a Santa Claus.\" Based on the true story of eight year old Virginia O’Hanlon who, in 1897, wrote a letter to the New York Sun asking if Santa Claus existed. The newspaper's response became part of America's holiday history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yfEUjBO-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Byers' Choice","source_asin":"B004OAAUVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004OAAUVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004OAAUVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
